pzmap2img renders maps the same way as pzmap2dzi (https://github.com/cff29546/pzmap2dzi), and
parts of it follow pzmap2dzi's code:

- the rules for which sprites make up each vegetation tile (src/textures/plants.rs), and the
  test fixtures in tests/fixtures/, which were generated by pzmap2dzi's plants.py;
- the fixed sprite size and the margins around each square (src/render/margins.rs);
- how vegetation sprites are combined and cropped (src/textures/build.rs);
- the load order of the game's texture packs (src/config.rs).

